pchar_errors.pas:46:8: error: cannot assign a String value to a PChar variable
  p := s;
       ^

pchar_errors.pas:39:8: error: this keeps a PChar into a Char array, which PascRust can't do (it lends a PChar to an array only for one statement); use a PChar from StrNew or GetMem instead
  p := buf;
       ^^^

pchar_errors.pas:40:8: error: this keeps a PChar into a Char array, which PascRust can't do (it lends a PChar to an array only for one statement); use a PChar from StrNew or GetMem instead
