       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

pchar_errors.pas:41:8: error: this keeps a PChar into a Char array, which PascRust can't do (it lends a PChar to an array only for one statement); use a PChar from StrNew or GetMem instead
  p := Echo(buf);
       ^^^^^^^^^

pchar_errors.pas:42:8: error: `Keep` keeps this PChar after it returns, which PascRust can't do for a Char array (it lends a PChar to an array only for one statement); use a PChar from StrNew or GetMem instead
